# Elderly Pursuits (otherAreas 75): 518 with no room for the Elegant Ribbon. Accepted at Prog 3 (a GM): Despachiaire
# nil, 106. Prog 4 (a GM) with the Cathedral Medallion; a full inventory (a GM): Despachiaire 518, finished:
# quest:complete fails (not completed), but the medallion is taken all the same (the Lua's delKeyItem is outside the
# if). Room again: 518, finished: completed. Available again (a GM): a trade to Despachiaire: no trade handler, nothing.
# 518 finished while the quest is available (a GM, while it is open): no section with 518, nothing.
lists TavnazianSafehold/Despachiaire/onTrigger TavnazianSafehold/Despachiaire/onTrade TavnazianSafehold/onEventFinish/518
char zone=TavnazianSafehold pos=112.7,-40,-85.5 job=WAR lvl=75
quest OtherAreas.SecretsOfOvensLost completed
quest OtherAreas.ElderlyPursuits accepted
charvar Quest[4][75]Prog 4
keyitem CathedralMedallion
item ChocoboFeather
login
charvar Quest[4][75]Prog 3              # a GM
trigger Despachiaire                    # Prog 3: nil; 106
finish
charvar Quest[4][75]Prog 4              # a GM
fill-inventory
trigger Despachiaire                    # Prog 4: 518
finish                                  # no room: not completed; the medallion taken anyway
free-inventory
trigger Despachiaire                    # 518
finish                                  # completed; the Elegant Ribbon
quest OtherAreas.ElderlyPursuits available # a GM
trade Despachiaire ChocoboFeather x1    # available: no trade handler; nothing
quest OtherAreas.ElderlyPursuits accepted # a GM
charvar Quest[4][75]Prog 4              # a GM
trigger Despachiaire                    # 518
quest OtherAreas.ElderlyPursuits available # a GM, while 518 is open
finish                                  # no 518 handler while available: nothing
